window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Thanks to her grandmother’s legacy, Morgen Keller has spent the summer learning about her witch heritage. She’s also spent the summer falling for the sexy werewolf next door. </p> <p>As an unemployed divorcée, she never expected to find love again. But the gruff Amar has been her protector since she arrived in Bellrock. He’s fierce, loyal, strong, and he hardly ever rolls his eyes at her vegetarian ways. He’s a keeper.</p> <p>There’s just one problem: Witches and werewolves are mortal enemies.</p> <p>When her mentor turns her back on her, and the coven delivers an ultimatum, Morgen must choose between her heritage and the man - the <i>werewolf - </i>she’s falling in love with. </p>"; 
